00022Cr 2               ; SetPalette - the sub-palettes from the players' trail colors: 1 is player 1,
00022Cr 2               ; 2 player 2, and 3 the border's blue round the edge and white inside it. Entry
00022Cr 2               ; 0, value 0 of the first, is black for the empty arena. The frame's entry is
00022Cr 2               ; SetWaiting's. The head sprites' white is entry 15, which stays as the card
00022Cr 2               ; has it.
00022Cr 2               SetPalette:
00022Cr 2  A9 03          lda #3
00022Er 2  20 rr rr       jsr SetVBank
000231r 2  A9 00          lda #<V_PALETTE
000233r 2  A2 3C          ldx #>V_PALETTE
000235r 2  20 rr rr       jsr VAddr
000238r 2  A9 05          lda #BORDER_FG
00023Ar 2  20 rr rr       jsr PutSub
00023Dr 2  A9 0F          lda #TMS_WHITE
00023Fr 2  20 rr rr       jsr PutSub
000242r 2  A9 00          lda #0
000244r 2  4C rr rr       jmp SetVBank
000247r 2               
000247r 2               ; PutSub - a sub-palette: nothing, the two trails, then color A.
000247r 2               PutSub:
